  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region $\\{(x, y):|x-5| \\leq y \\leq 4 \\sqrt{x}\\}$ is A , then 3 A is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "368",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/HvdZ_CyVHJzYZUO4bKb9DvC69ZY76y3TUVPoO-voQ9w.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & A=\\int_1^{25} 4 \\sqrt{x} d x-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 4-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 20 \\times 20 \\\\ & A=\\left[\\frac{4 x^{3 / 2}}{\\frac{3}{2}}\\right]^{25}-8-200 \\\\ & A=\\frac{8}{3}(125-1)-208 \\\\ & A=\\frac{368}{3} \\Rightarrow 3 A=368\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
